WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.301 --> 00:00:02.435
-I'm sorry to do this,
before we move on...

00:00:02.435 --> 00:00:04.804
there is something
that's been bothering me

00:00:04.804 --> 00:00:08.007
that I need
to get off my chest.

00:00:08.007 --> 00:00:12.011
I was at an important charity
gala dinner this morning...

00:00:12.011 --> 00:00:16.082
[ Laughter ]

00:00:19.652 --> 00:00:21.120
How did we miss that all week?

00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:24.391
[ Laughter ]

00:00:27.393 --> 00:00:30.697
And we proofread these things
so many times.

00:00:30.697 --> 00:00:34.233
Literally the first line
of this piece...

00:00:34.233 --> 00:00:37.036
I was at
an important charity gala dinner

00:00:37.036 --> 00:00:38.571
this morning...

00:00:38.571 --> 00:00:41.107
[ Laughter ]

00:00:43.709 --> 00:00:45.645
When this is over,
I'm going to have a second thing

00:00:45.645 --> 00:00:46.746
to get off my chest.

00:00:46.746 --> 00:00:48.881
[ Laughter ]

00:00:48.881 --> 00:00:52.118
I was having a great time
getting buzzed on fizzy wine

00:00:52.118 --> 00:00:53.519
when the affair took a turn.

00:00:53.519 --> 00:00:54.720
An acquaintance of mine

00:00:54.720 --> 00:00:56.488
soured an otherwise
delightful conversation

00:00:56.488 --> 00:00:58.992
by confiding in me that he was
turning 50 soon

00:00:58.992 --> 00:01:00.226
and he was scared.

00:01:00.226 --> 00:01:01.961
He said the best parts
of life are over,

00:01:01.961 --> 00:01:03.195
and he said he regretted
all the things

00:01:03.195 --> 00:01:04.831
he'd never got to do
while he was young.

00:01:04.831 --> 00:01:06.298
Needless to say,
I thought his blubbering

00:01:06.298 --> 00:01:07.700
was a big reeking pile of crap,

00:01:07.700 --> 00:01:09.869
and, lo, I told him so!

00:01:09.869 --> 00:01:12.405
Clutching his lapels
and shaking him like a rag doll,

00:01:12.405 --> 00:01:14.674
I shouted,
"Stop being a pathetic whiner!"

00:01:14.674 --> 00:01:16.643
And I'm sorry to anyone else

00:01:16.643 --> 00:01:19.545
feeling weird about their age,
but I don't.

00:01:19.545 --> 00:01:20.746
Because here's
the bottom line --

00:01:20.746 --> 00:01:22.982
50 is the new 20!

00:02:43.529 --> 00:02:45.165
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:52.405 --> 00:02:54.607
[ Laughter ]

00:03:03.583 --> 00:03:04.951
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:26.305 --> 00:03:27.640
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:06:19.912 --> 00:06:21.881
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:06:41.801 --> 00:06:43.635
-And the only thing
your 30-under list

00:06:43.635 --> 00:06:45.604
is good for is to wipe my ass!.

00:06:45.604 --> 00:06:48.574
Whew! That felt good
to get off my chest.

00:06:48.574 --> 00:06:50.910
We'll be right back
with Paul Giamatti, everybody.

